# Video files: GitHub hard-rejects anything over 100MB, and several
# existing bass-collection videos exceed that. Videos stay on disk (still
# served by dev/build/media-outbox) but aren't git-tracked — not part of
# this repo's automated media pipeline for now either. Revisit if/when
# video support is properly built out (e.g. via Git LFS or re-encoding).
public/images/**/*.mov
public/images/**/*.MOV
public/images/**/*.mp4
public/images/**/*.webm
public/images/**/*.m4v
